    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span class=\"GramE\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">金属龙</span></em></strong></span><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">起源</span></em></strong>。你的血脉可追溯到某只<span class=\"GramE\">金属龙</span>身上，这赋予<span class=\"GramE\">你特殊</span>的魔法亲和。从<span class=\"GramE\">金属龙</span>血脉表格中选择一项，这将决定<span class=\"GramE\">你其他</span>特性的伤害类型。</p>\n<p><span class=\"GramE\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">金属龙</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">血脉</span></strong><span><br></span>龙种<span>         </span>伤害类型<span><br></span>黄铜<span>          </span>火焰<span><br></span>青铜<span>          </span>闪电<span><br></span><span class=\"GramE\">赤</span>铜<span>          </span>强酸<span><br></span>金<span>              </span>火焰<span><br></span>银<span>              </span>寒冷<br>白       寒冷</p>",
